    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are familiar with blazing new routes and navigating the tangled web of Hyperspace in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"The Unknown Regions\">The Unknown Regions</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When traversing the Hyperspace Tangle, you reduce by half the calculation time and penalties on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> checks to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Astrogate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Astrogate\">Astrogate</a> (See <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hyperspace_Navigation_Challenges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hyperspace Navigation Challenges\">Hyperspace Navigation Challenges</a>). You also reduce Hyperspace Mapping time by half when mapping new Hyperspace Routes.</p>",
